'''Ravenous''' is a skill granted by {{il|Veruso's Ambition}}.

==Mechanics==
Ravenous is a [[spell]] that consumes a [[corpse]] near the targeted location, granting a [[buff]] that provides more [[damage]] against and less [[damage taken]] from monsters of the same [[monster category]] as the consumed corpse.

This buff has no [[duration]] and persists permanently in that [[instance]] until you [[death|die]], the area is exited, or the source of the skill is removed.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3452002#12|title=Path of Exile 2 and Path of Exile: Affliction Recently Asked Questions|date=December 3, 2023|accessdate=December 3, 2023}}</ref>. The buff can only provide bonuses against one monster category at a time and is overwritten when a new corpse is consumed. 

Ravenous ''cannot'' be used on spectral corpses created through [[skill]]s or [[corpse item]]s.

